    characteristics of the model. For models that allow multiple selected items,
    it is possible to turn on *rubberband selection*, using
    Gtk.ColumnView.props.enable_rubberband.

    The column view supports sorting that can be customized by the user by
    clicking on column headers. To set this up, the `Gtk.Sorter` returned by
    Gtk.ColumnView.get_sorter() must be attached to a sort model for the
    data that the view is showing, and the columns must have sorters attached to
    them by calling Gtk.ColumnViewColumn.set_sorter(). The initial sort
    order can be set with Gtk.ColumnView.sort_by_column().

