    shaders, you should use the Gtk.Widget.realize signal;
    you can use the Gtk.Widget.unrealize signal to clean up.
    Since the `Gdk.GLContext` creation and initialization may fail, you
    will need to check for errors, using Gtk.GLArea.get_error().

