    Gtk.MenuButton.props.icon_name property) or a label (set with the
    Gtk.MenuButton.props.label property). If neither is explicitly set,
    a Gtk.Image is automatically created, using an arrow image oriented
    according to Gtk.MenuButton.props.direction or the generic
    “open-menu-symbolic” icon if the direction is not set.

